.TH WERKMEISTER-WORKSPACE-CODE 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-workspace\-code \- Open a workspace in VS Code
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister workspace code\fR [feature]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Opens a workspace in VS Code. The dashboard's \fBopen\-workspace\fR tool does the same lookup and launch.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister workspace code my\-feature
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
